00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,861
Writing, task one. Form number 7. You want to rent a car. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,567 --> 00:00:15,911
For how many days and when do you want to rent the car?

3
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:31,246
I want to rent the car for four days, from Friday the twelfth to Monday the fifteenth of July.

4
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:33,673
Where are you going and why?

5
00:00:44,067 --> 00:00:48,266
We're going to Šumava with the family because we want to see the mountains and go hiking.

6
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:51,241
What car do you need and why?

7
00:01:01,633 --> 00:01:06,564
I need a big car for five people because we have three children and lots of luggage.

8
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:15,605
Fill in form 7 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
